cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Alora Kannada video dataset or this run-kit, please cite it as below."
title: "Alora Kannada Video Dataset and MiniMax H3 RTX 5090 run-kit"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Dhee AI"
    website: "https://github.com/dheeai"
version: "839-clip"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A curated collection of 839 short Kannada video clips (124 frames, 24 fps, 5.1667 s)
  with synced PCM16 mono 48 kHz audio and machine-generated Kannada captions, built for
  audiovisual generative-model training and benchmarking. Sources are CC-BY YouTube and
  Wikimedia Commons recordings. Captions, language identification, lip-sync and utterance
  boundaries are automated screening results, not human verification.
keywords:
  - Kannada
  - video dataset
  - audiovisual
  - MiniMax H3
  - LoRA
  - text-to-video
repository-artifact: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/aaron1z/alora-kannada-fleurs-v1"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dheeai/alora-h3-5090-run"